1
00:01:32,890 --> 00:01:35,009
[Forging Justice]

2
00:01:35,190 --> 00:01:37,680
[Episode 1]

3
00:01:43,789 --> 00:01:46,759
[1979, Jiangyang City]

4
00:02:02,230 --> 00:02:02,870
Mr. Xu,

5
00:02:03,480 --> 00:02:04,840
Chen Yizhong's level

6
00:02:04,950 --> 00:02:07,410
is good enough for a pro orchestra,
isn't it?

7
00:02:07,640 --> 00:02:08,900
He's just showing off.

8
00:02:11,520 --> 00:02:13,180
Have you been drinking again?

9
00:02:47,240 --> 00:02:49,240
Even if you stare a hole through him,

10
00:02:49,960 --> 00:02:50,710
it's no use.

11
00:02:55,400 --> 00:02:56,680
He looks down on us.

12
00:02:57,430 --> 00:02:58,079
He thinks that he belongs

13
00:02:58,079 --> 00:02:59,030
to the First World.

14
00:02:59,030 --> 00:03:00,230
People like you and me

15
00:03:00,400 --> 00:03:01,860
belong to the Third World.

16
00:03:01,910 --> 00:03:02,640
Do you get it?

17
00:03:04,430 --> 00:03:05,360
Get out of my way.

18
00:03:05,910 --> 00:03:07,040
Where are you going?

19
00:03:07,310 --> 00:03:08,360
Move.

20
00:03:09,030 --> 00:03:09,560
Chunyan.

21
00:03:10,310 --> 00:03:11,960
G-Get out of the way.

22
00:03:19,079 --> 00:03:19,630
Chunyan!

23
00:03:21,360 --> 00:03:22,820
Xue Chunyan! Xue Chunyan!

24
00:03:23,190 --> 00:03:23,960
What are you doing?

25
00:03:23,960 --> 00:03:24,540
What am I doing?

26
00:03:24,540 --> 00:03:25,470
You think you can leave, huh?

27
00:03:25,470 --> 00:03:26,200
Xue Chunyan.

28
00:03:26,560 --> 00:03:26,960
Du Xiaohui.

29
00:03:26,960 --> 00:03:27,360
Help!

30
00:03:28,630 --> 00:03:29,280
Mr. Xu!

31
00:03:29,560 --> 00:03:30,030
Let go.

32
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:32,060
I told you to let go!

33
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:34,240
I'm telling you, Du Xiaohui,

34
00:03:34,240 --> 00:03:35,120
if you dare do this again...

35
00:03:35,120 --> 00:03:36,320
So what if I dare do it?

36
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:38,430
If I dare do it again,

37
00:03:38,430 --> 00:03:39,630
what are you gonna do?

38
00:03:39,710 --> 00:03:40,910
Mr. Xu... Mr. Xu...

39
00:03:42,150 --> 00:03:43,150
How many fingers?

40
00:03:43,430 --> 00:03:45,000
Come here! Stay still!

41
00:03:45,910 --> 00:03:46,560
Damn!

42
00:03:47,079 --> 00:03:47,360
Damn!

43
00:03:47,360 --> 00:03:48,020
Du Xiaohui!

44
00:03:48,150 --> 00:03:48,480
Damn!

45
00:03:48,680 --> 00:03:49,810
Du Xiaohui, stop it!

46
00:03:49,870 --> 00:03:50,520
Mr. Xu!

47
00:03:55,630 --> 00:03:56,190
Damn!

48
00:03:56,400 --> 00:03:57,079
Help!

49
00:03:57,240 --> 00:03:58,370
You dare to hit back?

50
00:03:58,470 --> 00:03:59,150
Stop yelling!

51
00:03:59,150 --> 00:03:59,960
Get off!

52
00:04:03,590 --> 00:04:04,590
Mr. Xu, run!

53
00:04:14,120 --> 00:04:14,650
Let's go.

54
00:04:16,360 --> 00:04:16,920
Let's go!

55
00:04:17,630 --> 00:04:18,160
Let's go!

56
00:04:57,480 --> 00:04:59,120
This definitely wasn't from a fall.

57
00:04:59,120 --> 00:05:00,920
You got into a fight, didn't you?

58
00:05:01,190 --> 00:05:03,160
No. It was from a fall.

59
00:05:04,510 --> 00:05:05,840
Who would believe that?

60
00:05:06,560 --> 00:05:07,290
I was just...

61
00:05:07,480 --> 00:05:07,920
Originally...

62
00:05:07,920 --> 00:05:09,320
I-I-I... Originally...

63
00:05:09,680 --> 00:05:11,600
Can't even get your story straight, huh?

64
00:05:11,600 --> 00:05:13,630
You can never talk your way out
once you start lying.

65
00:05:13,630 --> 00:05:15,680
With your little scratch,
you think you can fool my mom?

66
00:05:15,680 --> 00:05:16,880
I'm really not lying.

67
00:05:20,360 --> 00:05:21,480
Can you keep your voice down?

68
00:05:21,480 --> 00:05:22,940
You're a girl, you know...

69
00:05:24,070 --> 00:05:25,130
I'm leaving first.

70
00:05:25,680 --> 00:05:27,190
Take your time with the bandaging.

71
00:05:27,190 --> 00:05:28,270
Wait for me.

72
00:05:28,560 --> 00:05:29,120
No.

73
00:05:30,270 --> 00:05:31,640
I don't want to be associated with you.

74
00:05:31,640 --> 00:05:33,040
There are so many gossips at school.

75
00:05:33,040 --> 00:05:34,770
They're so noisy and annoying.

76
00:05:35,600 --> 00:05:36,070
I'm off.

77
00:05:37,310 --> 00:05:39,170
Auntie, I think it's almost done.

78
00:05:39,620 --> 00:05:40,280
Don't move!

79
00:05:40,720 --> 00:05:42,040
I'll take you to the hospital later.

80
00:05:42,040 --> 00:05:43,100
You need stitches.

81
00:05:44,430 --> 00:05:45,090
Zhao Yumei.

82
00:05:45,630 --> 00:05:46,000
Here.

83
00:05:47,720 --> 00:05:48,480
Xue Chunyan.

84
00:05:50,800 --> 00:05:51,560
Xue Chunyan.

85
00:05:54,800 --> 00:05:56,330
Why isn't Xue Chunyan here?

86
00:05:58,360 --> 00:05:59,290
Where did she go?

87
00:06:02,480 --> 00:06:03,280
Chen Yizhong.

88
00:06:03,390 --> 00:06:03,720
Here.

89
00:06:03,920 --> 00:06:05,120
Do you know anything?

90
00:06:05,560 --> 00:06:06,290
I don't know.

91
00:06:07,680 --> 00:06:08,680
He doesn't know?

92
00:06:09,240 --> 00:06:09,970
Li Zhiqiang.

93
00:06:10,190 --> 00:06:10,430
Here.

94
00:06:10,430 --> 00:06:11,560
I really don't know.

95
00:06:11,630 --> 00:06:12,430
Wang Jianguo.

96
00:06:12,560 --> 00:06:13,000
Here.

97
00:06:15,160 --> 00:06:15,800
Cheng Jie.

98
00:06:15,950 --> 00:06:16,310
Here.

99
00:06:19,160 --> 00:06:20,020
Zhang Weidong.

100
00:06:32,950 --> 00:06:33,560
Mr. Xu.

101
00:06:39,070 --> 00:06:39,800
Are you okay?

102
00:06:40,750 --> 00:06:41,280
I'm fine.

103
00:06:44,190 --> 00:06:45,590
Thank you for yesterday.

104
00:06:46,430 --> 00:06:47,560
D-Don't mention it.

105
00:06:52,970 --> 00:06:53,890
Don't show off.

106
00:06:55,560 --> 00:06:56,750
Showing off will only make laymen

107
00:06:56,750 --> 00:06:57,950
think you're arrogant.

108
00:06:57,950 --> 00:06:58,630
Experts can immediately

109
00:06:58,630 --> 00:06:59,690
pick up your flaws.

110
00:07:01,390 --> 00:07:02,120
Give it to me.

111
00:07:15,560 --> 00:07:16,360
Play it again.

112
00:07:24,680 --> 00:07:25,310
Mr. Xu.

113
00:07:26,270 --> 00:07:27,000
Do you think

114
00:07:28,480 --> 00:07:29,510
I'll have a future

115
00:07:30,120 --> 00:07:31,120
if I keep practicing like this?

116
00:07:31,120 --> 00:07:31,920
What's wrong?

117
00:07:32,310 --> 00:07:34,240
Did your dad discourage you again?

118
00:07:34,430 --> 00:07:36,430
He hasn't discouraged me recently.

119
00:07:39,159 --> 00:07:41,360
I've just been doubting myself lately.

120
00:07:41,600 --> 00:07:42,950
I heard that in the field of music,

121
00:07:42,950 --> 00:07:44,000
ninety percent of success

122
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:45,460
comes from innate talent,

123
00:07:46,040 --> 00:07:47,440
not from sheer hard work.

124
00:07:47,830 --> 00:07:50,159
I'm afraid
that I'm just not cut out for it.

125
00:07:51,310 --> 00:07:52,440
With your aptitude,

126
00:07:52,830 --> 00:07:53,750
if you work hard,

127
00:07:53,750 --> 00:07:54,560
getting into a professional orchestra

128
00:07:54,560 --> 00:07:55,890
shouldn't be a problem.

129
00:07:56,270 --> 00:07:57,600
When I was at your age...

130
00:07:59,800 --> 00:08:01,730
That's all in the past. Never mind.

131
00:08:03,720 --> 00:08:04,720
You're both here.

132
00:08:10,430 --> 00:08:11,510
Something happened to Xue Chunyan,

133
00:08:11,510 --> 00:08:13,110
a girl from Class 3, Grade 11.

134
00:08:13,280 --> 00:08:13,680
She...

135
00:08:13,680 --> 00:08:15,740
We're here to ask you a few questions.

136
00:08:15,920 --> 00:08:18,250
Let's head to the police station and talk.

137
00:08:19,390 --> 00:08:21,680
You got home at 10:15.

138
00:08:22,070 --> 00:08:23,130
Who can prove that?

139
00:08:24,870 --> 00:08:25,720
When I got home,

140
00:08:25,720 --> 00:08:27,240
Mrs. Li who lives downstairs

141
00:08:27,240 --> 00:08:27,920
saw me.

142
00:08:31,240 --> 00:08:31,770
Yizhong.

143
00:08:32,510 --> 00:08:33,240
You're back.

144
00:08:36,789 --> 00:08:38,120
What time did you leave?

145
00:08:38,510 --> 00:08:39,909
They were in a group fight.

146
00:08:39,909 --> 00:08:41,570
It was pretty chaotic, so I...

147
00:08:41,840 --> 00:08:42,570
I left first.

148
00:08:42,870 --> 00:08:44,130
Xue Chunyan also left?

149
00:08:45,480 --> 00:08:46,080
I think so.

150
00:08:46,440 --> 00:08:47,200
You think so?

151
00:08:47,720 --> 00:08:49,250
Did you two leave together?

152
00:08:50,320 --> 00:08:50,870
No.

153
00:08:51,600 --> 00:08:52,460
She left first.

154
00:08:53,350 --> 00:08:54,750
Then I hurried straight home.

155
00:08:54,750 --> 00:08:56,870
After that fight with Du Xiaohui,

156
00:08:57,480 --> 00:08:59,140
did you see Xue Chunyan again?

157
00:08:59,440 --> 00:09:00,360
No, I didn't.

158
00:09:01,080 --> 00:09:02,540
What happened to Chunyan?

159
00:09:02,750 --> 00:09:03,880
Is something wrong?

160
00:09:04,390 --> 00:09:05,080
She's dead.

161
00:09:06,440 --> 00:09:07,240
Dead?

162
00:09:10,150 --> 00:09:11,110
How did she die?

163
00:09:12,390 --> 00:09:13,450
Go get a blood test.

164
00:09:15,390 --> 00:09:17,250
You said Du Xiaohui disappeared.

165
00:09:17,910 --> 00:09:19,440
Did he go after Xue Chunyan?

166
00:09:21,110 --> 00:09:22,240
Don't hold anything back.

167
00:09:22,240 --> 00:09:23,370
And don't be afraid.

168
00:09:35,320 --> 00:09:36,810
I passed out back then.

169
00:09:37,630 --> 00:09:38,890
I didn't see anything.

170
00:09:44,390 --> 00:09:45,320
Where's our son?

171
00:09:45,550 --> 00:09:46,080
In there.

172
00:09:46,360 --> 00:09:47,490
Why isn't he out yet?

173
00:09:48,240 --> 00:09:49,320
What's going on?

174
00:09:49,550 --> 00:09:51,680
Stop making a scene here. Come with me.

175
00:09:55,910 --> 00:09:57,440
What's the matter with you?

176
00:09:58,240 --> 00:09:59,870
How can you act like nothing happened?

177
00:09:59,870 --> 00:10:00,720
I trust my son.

178
00:10:01,000 --> 00:10:02,600
Of course. I trust my son too!

179
00:10:02,720 --> 00:10:04,120
Then do you trust the law?

180
00:10:04,790 --> 00:10:06,510
You think
you're still the presiding judge?

181
00:10:06,510 --> 00:10:07,910
You're just a barber.

182
00:10:08,000 --> 00:10:09,270
It has nothing to do
with being a presiding judge.

183
00:10:09,270 --> 00:10:10,600
This has to do with the law.

184
00:10:10,600 --> 00:10:12,330
We don't have any other choice.

185
00:10:13,080 --> 00:10:14,280
Go. Get out of the car.

186
00:10:14,670 --> 00:10:15,080
Go.

187
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:17,550
Isn't that Director Du's son?

188
00:10:17,550 --> 00:10:18,200
Xiaohui?

189
00:10:18,670 --> 00:10:19,800
He was involved too?

190
00:10:23,390 --> 00:10:24,190
Chen Yizhong?

191
00:10:26,740 --> 00:10:27,240
Chen Yizhong!

192
00:10:27,240 --> 00:10:28,970
What the hell did you tell them?

193
00:10:29,630 --> 00:10:31,030
What the hell did you tell them?

194
00:10:31,030 --> 00:10:31,830
Chen Yizhong!

195
00:10:32,670 --> 00:10:33,960
This is retaliation.

196
00:10:34,670 --> 00:10:35,120
Chen Yizhong!

197
00:10:35,120 --> 00:10:36,630
This is retaliation!

198
00:10:38,550 --> 00:10:39,080
Son!

199
00:10:39,390 --> 00:10:40,580
What happened?

200
00:10:41,960 --> 00:10:43,160
How did you get hurt?

201
00:10:46,240 --> 00:10:47,100
I'm asking you!

202
00:10:49,910 --> 00:10:50,770
Have some more.

203
00:10:50,790 --> 00:10:51,570
No more, Mom.

204
00:10:51,840 --> 00:10:54,040
You haven't eaten anything in two days.

205
00:10:55,240 --> 00:10:56,000
They won't

206
00:10:56,120 --> 00:10:58,120
take Yizhong away again, will they?

207
00:10:59,320 --> 00:10:59,980
Hard to say.

208
00:11:00,760 --> 00:11:01,720
But I think he's probably

209
00:11:01,720 --> 00:11:02,780
off the hook by now.

210
00:11:03,150 --> 00:11:04,320
He has an alibi.

211
00:11:06,270 --> 00:11:07,870
Mr. Xu hasn't been released.

212
00:11:08,390 --> 00:11:10,150
Anything is possible.

213
00:11:10,750 --> 00:11:11,870
But son,

214
00:11:12,120 --> 00:11:13,480
if you didn't see anything,

215
00:11:13,480 --> 00:11:14,680
don't talk nonsense.

216
00:11:14,960 --> 00:11:16,070
It's about a person's life.

217
00:11:16,070 --> 00:11:16,960
Two.

218
00:11:17,870 --> 00:11:19,080
If the killer is caught,

219
00:11:19,080 --> 00:11:20,480
it's definitely the death penalty.

220
00:11:20,480 --> 00:11:22,480
Chen Yizhong, get down here right now!

221
00:11:22,480 --> 00:11:23,030
Chen Fan!

222
00:11:23,320 --> 00:11:24,950
Your son falsely accused our Xiaohui.

223
00:11:24,950 --> 00:11:25,670
Get down here

224
00:11:25,670 --> 00:11:26,510
and give me an explanation!

225
00:11:26,510 --> 00:11:27,510
Get down here now!

226
00:11:28,720 --> 00:11:29,450
Director Du.

227
00:11:29,720 --> 00:11:30,580
What are you...

228
00:11:31,750 --> 00:11:32,550
Chen Yizhong!

229
00:11:32,630 --> 00:11:33,120
What do you want?

230
00:11:33,120 --> 00:11:34,960
Come with me to the police station
and clear this up!

231
00:11:34,960 --> 00:11:35,490
Let's go!

232
00:11:35,510 --> 00:11:36,200
Calm down!

233
00:11:36,220 --> 00:11:37,390
You need to trust the law

234
00:11:37,390 --> 00:11:38,650
and trust the police!

235
00:11:38,720 --> 00:11:39,360
I only trust

236
00:11:39,360 --> 00:11:40,480
that my son is innocent!

237
00:11:40,480 --> 00:11:41,010
Let's go!

238
00:11:41,670 --> 00:11:42,150
Director Du!

239
00:11:42,150 --> 00:11:42,730
Wait!

240
00:11:42,790 --> 00:11:43,630
What you're doing

241
00:11:43,630 --> 00:11:44,390
is threatening

242
00:11:44,390 --> 00:11:45,320
the personal safety of a witness.

243
00:11:45,320 --> 00:11:46,870
You will be held legally responsible
for this!

244
00:11:46,870 --> 00:11:47,800
Get out of my way!

245
00:11:48,000 --> 00:11:49,030
A reactionary father raises a bastard son.

246
00:11:49,030 --> 00:11:50,600
This is all your bad parenting!

247
00:11:50,600 --> 00:11:51,130
Let's go!

248
00:11:51,520 --> 00:11:51,910
Let's go!

249
00:11:51,910 --> 00:11:52,480
Du Guoying,

250
00:11:52,480 --> 00:11:53,390
you can't do this!

251
00:11:53,390 --> 00:11:54,450
What are you doing?

252
00:11:54,510 --> 00:11:56,120
All you know is bullying ordinary people!

253
00:11:56,120 --> 00:11:56,510
If you've got the guts,

254
00:11:56,510 --> 00:11:58,120
go plead your case at the police station!

255
00:11:58,120 --> 00:11:59,790
You're just picking on the weak!

256
00:11:59,790 --> 00:12:00,870
You slut!

257
00:12:01,080 --> 00:12:02,120
You profiteer!

258
00:12:02,140 --> 00:12:03,140
Who do you think you are to speak here?

259
00:12:03,140 --> 00:12:04,800
How dare you insult my mother!

260
00:12:05,840 --> 00:12:06,390
Yizhong!

261
00:12:06,870 --> 00:12:07,600
Enough!

262
00:12:17,390 --> 00:12:18,450
What are you doing?

263
00:12:20,480 --> 00:12:22,320
Are you trying to get someone killed?

264
00:12:22,320 --> 00:12:24,720
Do you want to pile more charges
on your son?

265
00:12:28,270 --> 00:12:28,800
Get lost!

266
00:12:31,270 --> 00:12:31,750
Fine.

267
00:12:32,470 --> 00:12:32,910
Fine.

268
00:12:34,840 --> 00:12:35,670
You win.

269
00:12:36,550 --> 00:12:37,320
You win.

270
00:12:39,360 --> 00:12:39,890
Let's go!

271
00:12:41,790 --> 00:12:43,390
The law won't wrong your son.

272
00:12:44,150 --> 00:12:45,950
And I didn't falsely accuse him.

273
00:12:55,200 --> 00:12:55,960
Yizhong.

274
00:12:56,950 --> 00:12:58,080
Don't say anything.

275
00:12:58,550 --> 00:12:59,960
When they insulted you, you kept quiet.

276
00:12:59,960 --> 00:13:00,360
Fine.

277
00:13:01,240 --> 00:13:03,200
When they insulted my mother,
you still kept quiet.

278
00:13:03,200 --> 00:13:04,400
What are you good for?

279
00:13:13,200 --> 00:13:14,800
Then what do you want me to do?

280
00:13:15,720 --> 00:13:16,360
Beat him?

281
00:13:16,840 --> 00:13:18,100
Fight back with words?

282
00:13:18,540 --> 00:13:20,030
Your dad handled it the right way.

283
00:13:20,030 --> 00:13:20,550
Mom.

284
00:13:20,550 --> 00:13:22,680
How was that right? How was that right?

285
00:13:22,840 --> 00:13:23,870
Back then, Du Guoying's wife

286
00:13:23,870 --> 00:13:25,030
brought so many people to bully you.

287
00:13:25,030 --> 00:13:26,360
My dad didn't say a word.

288
00:13:26,360 --> 00:13:28,690
Even today, he still keeps his mouth shut.

289
00:13:29,870 --> 00:13:30,480
Enough.

290
00:13:31,600 --> 00:13:32,390
Stop it.

291
00:13:32,840 --> 00:13:33,600
Look at you.

292
00:13:34,300 --> 00:13:35,760
How can you protect my mom?

293
