00:27:16,030 --> 00:27:18,640
he shouldn't be wrongfully executed
if he didn't kill anyone.

584
00:27:18,640 --> 00:27:20,070
How do you know he didn't kill anyone?

585
00:27:20,070 --> 00:27:21,070
What if he didn't?

586
00:27:24,270 --> 00:27:25,480
You came to me in the middle of the night.

587
00:27:25,480 --> 00:27:26,740
What do you want to say?

588
00:27:30,590 --> 00:27:31,250
Go to sleep.

589
00:27:31,510 --> 00:27:31,960
Wait.

590
00:27:33,000 --> 00:27:33,800
Chen Yizhong!

591
00:27:36,640 --> 00:27:37,240
Mr. Xu.

592
00:27:37,750 --> 00:27:38,880
There's something

593
00:27:39,270 --> 00:27:41,110
I want to ask you clearly in person.

594
00:27:41,110 --> 00:27:41,640
Go ahead.

595
00:27:42,680 --> 00:27:44,160
Last night you were drunk.

596
00:27:44,480 --> 00:27:45,140
You said...

597
00:27:47,160 --> 00:27:48,030
You said

598
00:27:48,480 --> 00:27:50,740
that you accidentally hurt Xue Chunyan,

599
00:27:52,650 --> 00:27:53,720
but it wasn't intentional.

600
00:27:53,720 --> 00:27:55,720
You were just too angry at that time.

601
00:27:57,550 --> 00:27:58,720
So I want to ask you

602
00:27:59,640 --> 00:28:01,240
whether Xue Chunyan's death

603
00:28:01,880 --> 00:28:03,410
had anything to do with you.

604
00:28:11,640 --> 00:28:12,170
Go ahead.

605
00:28:13,510 --> 00:28:14,160
Turn me in.

606
00:28:16,000 --> 00:28:18,460
Maybe you'll even
be rewarded for your merit

607
00:28:19,510 --> 00:28:21,830
and get a direct recommendation
to the provincial orchestra.

608
00:28:21,830 --> 00:28:23,270
T-That's not what I meant.

609
00:28:23,270 --> 00:28:23,750
Mr. Xu.

610
00:28:23,920 --> 00:28:24,380
Really.

611
00:28:24,720 --> 00:28:25,070
I didn't...

612
00:28:25,070 --> 00:28:25,640
Go ahead.

613
00:28:25,880 --> 00:28:26,540
I didn't...

614
00:28:26,680 --> 00:28:27,720
What if I run away?

615
00:28:33,880 --> 00:28:35,280
I've got a ticket for 2 PM.

616
00:28:37,510 --> 00:28:38,310
Mr. Xu.

617
00:28:39,510 --> 00:28:41,710
Du Xiaohui has been sentenced to death.

618
00:28:43,110 --> 00:28:44,110
I was thinking...

619
00:28:44,590 --> 00:28:46,400
If he is not the killer,

620
00:28:47,400 --> 00:28:49,260
no matter how small the chance is,

621
00:28:50,770 --> 00:28:51,850
I want to give him

622
00:28:51,880 --> 00:28:52,920
a chance to live.

623
00:28:56,440 --> 00:28:57,110
Mr. Xu.

624
00:28:58,070 --> 00:28:58,880
I came today

625
00:28:59,480 --> 00:29:00,810
to give you a chance too.

626
00:29:05,960 --> 00:29:07,690
You're a teacher I really like.

627
00:29:18,880 --> 00:29:20,750
Who do you think you are, Chen Yizhong?

628
00:29:20,750 --> 00:29:22,280
Are you some kind of savior?

629
00:29:28,750 --> 00:29:29,720
Indeed,

630
00:29:30,270 --> 00:29:33,200
there was a time
when I was as adorably foolish as you.

631
00:29:34,240 --> 00:29:36,370
But unfortunately, that version of me

632
00:29:38,240 --> 00:29:39,450
died a long time ago.

633
00:29:48,750 --> 00:29:49,680
Do you think

634
00:29:49,680 --> 00:29:51,160
either Du Xiaohui or I

635
00:29:51,160 --> 00:29:52,270
must be the killer?

636
00:29:54,110 --> 00:29:54,880
N-No.

637
00:29:54,960 --> 00:29:56,290
I'll tell you the truth.

638
00:29:57,030 --> 00:29:58,000
Xue Chunyan and I

639
00:29:59,030 --> 00:30:01,160
had been together for over half a year.

640
00:30:02,350 --> 00:30:03,350
No one knows that,

641
00:30:05,720 --> 00:30:06,640
except you.

642
00:30:10,830 --> 00:30:12,110
And I did hurt her,

643
00:30:15,200 --> 00:30:16,730
but not in the way you think.

644
00:30:18,240 --> 00:30:19,310
That night, we...

645
00:30:20,750 --> 00:30:21,750
we had a fight.

646
00:30:25,110 --> 00:30:27,040
I walked her to the fork in the road.

647
00:30:28,240 --> 00:30:29,070
But if I had

648
00:30:29,070 --> 00:30:30,600
walked her all the way home,

649
00:30:32,510 --> 00:30:34,370
none of that would have happened.

650
00:30:34,550 --> 00:30:35,400
Did you

651
00:30:36,480 --> 00:30:38,010
tell all this to the police?

652
00:30:38,750 --> 00:30:40,550
I didn't. I didn't say anything.

653
00:30:41,200 --> 00:30:42,600
I have to protect myself.

654
00:30:43,270 --> 00:30:44,240
And I have to leave Chunyan

655
00:30:44,240 --> 00:30:46,640
with at least a little dignity
and privacy.

656
00:30:48,480 --> 00:30:49,000
Also,

657
00:30:50,960 --> 00:30:52,160
I don't trust the law.

658
00:30:54,070 --> 00:30:55,440
Do you know

659
00:30:55,960 --> 00:30:58,310
what "innocent until proven guilty" means?

660
00:30:58,310 --> 00:31:00,240
Many legal professionals
don't even know it.

661
00:31:00,240 --> 00:31:01,570
Go home and ask your dad.

662
00:31:02,310 --> 00:31:03,000
Things

663
00:31:03,700 --> 00:31:05,270
like not wronging a single good person

664
00:31:05,270 --> 00:31:07,400
and not letting a single bad one go free

665
00:31:09,030 --> 00:31:10,160
are never that easy.

666
00:31:14,000 --> 00:31:14,480
Just go.

667
00:31:15,720 --> 00:31:16,590
Before 2 PM,

668
00:31:16,590 --> 00:31:18,250
if you don't come to arrest me,

669
00:31:20,510 --> 00:31:21,160
you'll never

670
00:31:21,160 --> 00:31:22,000
find me again.

671
00:31:22,750 --> 00:31:23,270
Go.

672
00:31:25,200 --> 00:31:25,830
Go!

673
00:31:30,140 --> 00:31:35,930
[Jiangyang Public Security Bureau]

674
00:31:41,360 --> 00:31:41,920
Comrade.

675
00:31:42,240 --> 00:31:43,550
I'd like to see Captain Xiao.

676
00:31:43,550 --> 00:31:44,200
He's out.

677
00:31:44,880 --> 00:31:45,610
Why do you need to see him?

678
00:31:45,610 --> 00:31:47,010
Hurry up. The car is here.

679
00:31:48,790 --> 00:31:50,450
Maybe you can come back later.

680
00:32:00,680 --> 00:32:02,640
What's with the prim and proper act,
Xu Zhao?

681
00:32:02,640 --> 00:32:03,480
Tao Yihong,

682
00:32:03,920 --> 00:32:05,550
the one who played the violin,

683
00:32:05,550 --> 00:32:06,510
jumped off a building,

684
00:32:06,510 --> 00:32:07,640
and she was pregnant!

685
00:32:07,640 --> 00:32:08,110
Chunyan.

686
00:32:08,110 --> 00:32:09,770
You didn't know that, did you?

687
00:32:10,270 --> 00:32:11,470
Go to hell! Go to hell!

688
00:32:14,030 --> 00:32:15,090
Chunyan, let's go.

689
00:32:16,680 --> 00:32:17,810
Is what he said true?

690
00:32:19,080 --> 00:32:20,200
Don't listen to their nonsense.

691
00:32:20,200 --> 00:32:20,730
Let's go.

692
00:32:20,830 --> 00:32:21,680
Let go of me!

693
00:32:23,680 --> 00:32:24,740
I can walk on my own.

694
00:32:46,240 --> 00:32:47,570
Did Xue Chunyan's death

695
00:32:48,270 --> 00:32:49,870
have anything to do with you?

696
00:33:27,720 --> 00:33:28,350
Ready.

697
00:33:49,880 --> 00:33:50,680
Before 2 PM,

698
00:33:50,680 --> 00:33:52,340
if you don't come to arrest me,

699
00:33:53,640 --> 00:33:54,270
you'll never

700
00:33:54,270 --> 00:33:55,110
find me again.

701
00:33:59,830 --> 00:34:01,030
I don't trust the law.

702
00:34:02,720 --> 00:34:03,680
Do you know

703
00:34:03,680 --> 00:34:05,830
what "innocent until proven guilty" means?

704
00:34:05,830 --> 00:34:07,480
Not wronging a single good person.

705
00:34:07,480 --> 00:34:09,679
Not letting a single bad person go free.

706
00:34:09,840 --> 00:34:11,040
It's never that easy.

707
00:34:30,590 --> 00:34:31,850
You... What are you...

708
00:34:32,750 --> 00:34:34,880
I found 0.24 yuan in Xiaohui's clothes

709
00:34:35,030 --> 00:34:36,590
when I was going

710
00:34:36,590 --> 00:34:38,480
through his things.

711
00:34:42,100 --> 00:34:43,710
I've got no use for it.

712
00:34:47,440 --> 00:34:48,840
You keep it as a souvenir.

713
00:34:53,409 --> 00:34:56,070
Or you can give it to your son
as New Year's money.

714
00:35:18,670 --> 00:35:19,870
Stop drinking alone.

715
00:35:22,190 --> 00:35:22,920
I heard

716
00:35:23,800 --> 00:35:25,060
that Du Guoying's wife

717
00:35:25,760 --> 00:35:27,620
broke down crying several times.

718
00:35:27,760 --> 00:35:28,510
Although their family

719
00:35:28,510 --> 00:35:29,640
isn't that great...

720
00:35:29,960 --> 00:35:31,090
Anyway, this grudge

721
00:35:31,400 --> 00:35:33,000
between our families is set.

722
00:35:33,630 --> 00:35:34,730
Don't dwell on it.

723
00:35:36,280 --> 00:35:37,680
He also went to the trial.

724
00:35:37,920 --> 00:35:38,590
And he knows

725
00:35:38,880 --> 00:35:40,150
what happened to his son

726
00:35:40,150 --> 00:35:41,880
had nothing to do with Yizhong.

727
00:35:43,700 --> 00:35:45,960
I'm just afraid they'll take it out on us.

728
00:35:47,670 --> 00:35:48,360
From now on,

729
00:35:48,550 --> 00:35:49,880
you and Yizhong

730
00:35:51,110 --> 00:35:53,040
just keep your distance from them.

731
00:36:00,630 --> 00:36:01,510
Come on, eat.

732
00:36:17,320 --> 00:36:17,850
Yizhong.

733
00:36:20,800 --> 00:36:21,670
Do you know

734
00:36:21,670 --> 00:36:24,130
what "innocent until proven guilty" means?

735
00:36:26,280 --> 00:36:28,140
Innocent until proven guilty...

736
00:36:30,440 --> 00:36:31,260
Simply put,

737
00:36:32,240 --> 00:36:34,560
it's derived

738
00:36:34,590 --> 00:36:35,920
from the presumption of innocence.

739
00:36:35,920 --> 00:36:37,030
And it's a kind of protection

740
00:36:37,030 --> 00:36:39,360
for the personal rights of the defendant.

741
00:36:39,550 --> 00:36:40,480
The presumption of innocence...

742
00:36:40,480 --> 00:36:41,480
In Du Xiaohui's case,

743
00:36:41,480 --> 00:36:42,550
if they had followed

744
00:36:42,550 --> 00:36:44,590
the "innocent until proven guilty"
principle,

745
00:36:44,590 --> 00:36:47,050
could he still have been sentenced
to death?

746
00:36:49,840 --> 00:36:51,190
That "innocent until proven guilty"
principle,

747
00:36:51,190 --> 00:36:52,000
at this stage,

748
00:36:52,000 --> 00:36:53,480
is not yet a principle

749
00:36:53,480 --> 00:36:55,810
of our country's criminal procedure law.

750
00:36:56,590 --> 00:36:58,190
The law also needs to evolve.

751
00:36:59,110 --> 00:36:59,960
And it can't escape

752
00:36:59,960 --> 00:37:00,960
the limitations of the times.

753
00:37:00,960 --> 00:37:02,000
Dad, can you...

754
00:37:04,150 --> 00:37:05,810
stop beating around the bush?

755
00:37:11,110 --> 00:37:11,910
You eat first.

756
00:37:12,360 --> 00:37:13,960
We'll talk after you finish.

757
00:37:15,840 --> 00:37:16,700
What is this...

758
00:37:19,380 --> 00:37:20,310
I'll go for a bit.

759
00:37:21,590 --> 00:37:22,400
Talk nicely.

760
00:37:24,670 --> 00:37:25,480
Talk nicely.

761
00:37:32,150 --> 00:37:34,010
Unless you discover significant

762
00:37:34,280 --> 00:37:35,510
or new evidence,

763
00:37:35,960 --> 00:37:36,560
the police

764
00:37:37,070 --> 00:37:38,930
won't reopen the investigation.

765
00:37:39,280 --> 00:37:40,230
Getting the court to overturn the verdict

766
00:37:40,230 --> 00:37:41,360
is even less likely.

767
00:37:43,160 --> 00:37:44,080
Before Xu Zhao

768
00:37:44,110 --> 00:37:45,670
said all this to you,

769
00:37:46,590 --> 00:37:48,030
did you also think

770
00:37:48,590 --> 00:37:50,320
that Du Xiaohui was the killer?

771
00:37:51,480 --> 00:37:52,360
Yes, I did.

772
00:37:57,840 --> 00:37:59,640
Being able to doubt your own view

773
00:38:00,550 --> 00:38:03,010
and bring up
"innocent until proven guilty"

774
00:38:03,670 --> 00:38:05,110
is already quite impressive.

775
00:38:05,110 --> 00:38:06,550
Then nobody knows

776
00:38:06,550 --> 00:38:07,440
who the real killer is?

777
00:38:07,440 --> 00:38:07,960
What if

778
00:38:08,510 --> 00:38:10,310
Du Xiaohui was wrongly accused?

779
00:38:12,960 --> 00:38:13,760
There are many situations

780
00:38:13,760 --> 00:38:15,590
where you try your best,

781
00:38:16,110 --> 00:38:16,910
but in the end,

782
00:38:17,510 --> 00:38:18,510
you still can't find

783
00:38:18,510 --> 00:38:19,370
a clear answer.

784
00:38:19,920 --> 00:38:20,920
That is precisely

785
00:38:21,480 --> 00:38:23,610
why we do what we know may be impossible

786
00:38:24,000 --> 00:38:26,060
and search high and low for the truth.

787
00:38:27,880 --> 00:38:28,610
Working hard

788
00:38:29,670 --> 00:38:31,510
to get more right answers

789
00:38:32,630 --> 00:38:33,710
is more valuable.

790
00:38:36,590 --> 00:38:37,430
Go study law.

791
00:38:39,070 --> 00:38:41,870
You're not cut out
for playing the trumpet anyway.

792
00:39:04,710 --> 00:39:08,210
[1980, Beijing City]

793
00:39:08,920 --> 00:39:10,370
The golden autumn brings cool breezes,

794
00:39:10,370 --> 00:39:12,150
and the sweet osmanthus fills the air
with its fragrance.

795
00:39:12,150 --> 00:39:14,360
In this beautiful season

796
00:39:14,360 --> 00:39:15,400
that is full of hope and vitality,

797
00:39:15,100 --> 00:39:18,220
♪ Young friends,
let us gather here today ♪

798
00:39:15,760 --> 00:39:17,150
we joyfully

799
00:39:17,440 --> 00:39:18,320
welcome

800
00:39:18,240 --> 00:39:21,730
♪ We row our little boats
as the warm breeze gently blows ♪

801
00:39:18,320 --> 00:39:21,050
our new students from all corners
of the country.

802
00:39:21,920 --> 00:39:23,760
With the ideals of youth,

803
00:39:22,150 --> 00:39:23,980
♪ Fragrant flowers bloom, and birds sing ♪

804
00:39:24,000 --> 00:39:26,000
♪ The beauty of spring captivates us ♪

805
00:39:24,070 --> 00:39:25,630
the expectations of your hometowns,

806
00:39:25,630 --> 00:39:26,960
and the passion for knowledge,

807
00:39:26,020 --> 00:39:29,230
♪ Joyful songs and laughter fill the air
beneath the colorful clouds ♪

808
00:39:27,360 --> 00:39:29,550
you've stepped into our beautiful campus.

809
00:39:29,300 --> 00:39:31,040
♪ Oh, my dear friends ♪

810
00:39:31,330 --> 00:39:33,130
♪ To whom
does this beautiful springtime belong? ♪

811
00:39:31,840 --> 00:39:32,320
Hey,

812
00:39:32,550 --> 00:39:33,880
how do I get to the Law Department?

813
00:39:33,520 --> 00:39:36,630
♪ It belongs to me, it belongs to you ♪

814
00:39:33,940 --> 00:39:34,710
The Law Department is

815
00:39:34,710 --> 00:39:36,230
up these stairs.
You'll see it on the right.

816
00:39:36,230 --> 00:39:36,800
On the right, right?

817
00:39:36,800 --> 00:39:37,030
Yes.

818
00:39:36,880 --> 00:39:40,880
♪ It belongs to
our new generation of the 1980s ♪

819
00:39:37,190 --> 00:39:37,630
Thank you.

820
00:39:37,630 --> 00:39:38,560
You're welcome.

821
00:39:41,910 --> 00:39:44,380
♪ Twenty years from now,
we'll meet again ♪

822
00:39:45,080 --> 00:39:48,380
♪ Just imagine how beautiful
our great motherland will be ♪

823
00:39:48,810 --> 00:39:50,560
♪ A new world, a new dawn ♪

824
00:39:50,700 --> 00:39:52,340
♪ With spring shining brighter than ever ♪

825
00:39:52,750 --> 00:39:55,680
♪ From cities to villages,
everywhere will shine with new splendor ♪

826
00:39:59,480 --> 00:40:00,070
Excuse me.

827
00:40:00,070 --> 00:40:01,000
Hello, I'd like to ask

828
00:40:01,000 --> 00:40:02,150
how to get to the Sociology Department?

829
00:40:02,150 --> 00:40:03,440
For the Sociology Department,
go around this way.

830
00:40:03,440 --> 00:40:04,670
You'll see it right by Canteen 1.

831
00:40:04,670 --> 00:40:05,030
Thank you.

832
00:40:05,030 --> 00:40:06,190
-You're welcome.
-Thank you.

833
00:40:06,190 --> 00:40:07,840
Excuse me,

834
00:40:08,030 --> 00:40:09,150
do you know
where the Law Department registration

835
00:40:09,150 --> 00:40:09,880
is held?

836
00:40:10,000 --> 00:40:11,000
I'm from the Law Department myself.

837
00:40:11,000 --> 00:40:11,440
Really?

838
00:40:11,440 --> 00:40:13,320
Our department is registering
in the classroom on the second floor.

839
00:40:13,320 --> 00:40:14,000
My name is Yu Gaoyuan.

840
00:40:14,000 --> 00:40:14,880
Hello, I am Xia Yingjie.

841
00:40:14,880 --> 00:40:15,800
Let me help you with that.

842
00:40:15,800 --> 00:40:16,920
-Thank you.
-You're welcome.

843
00:40:16,920 --> 00:40:17,760
What year are you in?

844
00:40:17,760 --> 00:40:19,960
-I'm in the same year as you...
-Excuse me.

845
00:40:19,960 --> 00:40:21,280
How do I get to the Law Department?

846
00:40:21,280 --> 00:40:22,670
You're in the Law Department too?

847
00:40:22,670 --> 00:40:23,400
Come with us.

848
00:40:23,770 --> 00:40:24,360
Let me help you with it.

849
00:40:24,360 --> 00:40:24,960
Thank you.

850
00:40:25,000 --> 00:40:25,630
No problem.

851
00:40:25,630 --> 00:40:26,360
What is your name?

852
00:40:26,360 --> 00:40:27,070
Zhang Lihui.

853
00:40:27,070 --> 00:40:28,030
I am Xia Yingjie.

854
00:40:28,150 --> 00:40:28,710
Nice to meet you.

855
00:40:28,710 --> 00:40:29,320
I am Yu Gaoyuan.

856
00:40:29,320 --> 00:40:30,280
I am in the same year as you.

857
00:40:30,280 --> 00:40:31,550
I just came a couple of days early

858
00:40:31,550 --> 00:40:32,670
to help with orientation.

859
00:40:32,670 --> 00:40:33,270
Excuse me.

860
00:40:33,920 --> 00:40:35,520
Where is the Law Department?

861
00:40:35,760 --> 00:40:37,150
I've already walked
around the whole place.

862
00:40:37,150 --> 00:40:37,570
On the second floor.

863
00:40:37,570 --> 00:40:38,960
We're all Law Department students.

864
00:40:38,960 --> 00:40:39,840
You are in the Law Department too?

865
00:40:39,840 --> 00:40:40,230
Yes.

866
00:40:41,240 --> 00:40:42,070
What is your name?

867
00:40:42,070 --> 00:40:43,150
I am Lu Zeming.

868
00:40:43,710 --> 00:40:45,800
The 'ming' in my name
means astounding everyone...

869
00:40:45,800 --> 00:40:49,460
No... Ming... It's actually the character
with the gold radical.

870
00:40:59,550 --> 00:41:00,400
Two years ago,

871
00:41:01,840 --> 00:41:04,130
many fields in our country
still had no laws to govern them.

872
00:41:04,130 --> 00:41:06,200
[Legal professional]

873
00:41:06,060 --> 00:41:07,460
For such a large country,

874
00:41:07,960 --> 00:41:08,960
there was not even

875
00:41:08,960 --> 00:41:09,880
an official criminal law

876
00:41:09,880 --> 00:41:11,410
or criminal procedure law.

877
00:41:11,840 --> 00:41:12,840
I took part

878
00:41:13,280 --> 00:41:14,670
in drafting the criminal law

879
00:41:14,670 --> 00:41:16,200
and criminal procedure law

880
00:41:17,190 --> 00:41:19,120
that came into force this January.

881
00:41:19,590 --> 00:41:20,400
In a way,

882
00:41:21,590 --> 00:41:22,230
I've witnessed the process

883
00:41:22,230 --> 00:41:24,560
of something being created from nothing.

884
00:41:24,800 --> 00:41:26,580
[Criminal Procedure Law
of the People's Republic of China]

885
00:41:24,800 --> 00:41:26,580
[Criminal Law
of the People's Republic of China]

886
00:41:25,440 --> 00:41:26,500
More than 30 years.

887
00:41:26,800 --> 00:41:28,060
An entire generation.

888
00:41:28,960 --> 00:41:31,890
This is the criminal law
and criminal procedure law.

889
00:41:32,150 --> 00:41:32,800
I believe

890
00:41:33,230 --> 00:41:34,630
that every one of you here

891
00:41:34,800 --> 00:41:36,150
will be able to recite it
backwards and forwards

892
00:41:36,150 --> 00:41:37,210
in less than a year.

893
00:41:38,920 --> 00:41:40,840
But with all these years
of your undergraduate study...

894
00:41:40,840 --> 00:41:42,030
Two months, at most.

895
00:41:45,320 --> 00:41:46,740
Someone said two months?

896
00:41:47,670 --> 00:41:48,440
Impressive.

897
00:41:49,440 --> 00:41:50,440
What's your name?

898
00:41:51,150 --> 00:41:52,280
My name is Lu Zeming.

899
00:41:52,550 --> 00:41:53,370
Lu Zeming.

900
00:41:53,840 --> 00:41:54,900
That's a good name.

901
00:41:55,710 --> 00:41:56,800
Either you stay silent,

902
00:41:56,800 --> 00:41:58,200
or you astound everyone.

903
00:41:59,280 --> 00:41:59,880
All right.

904
00:42:00,360 --> 00:42:01,550
Two months from now...

905
00:42:01,550 --> 00:42:03,110
Today is the 9th.

906
00:42:03,440 --> 00:42:04,440
November 9th.

907
00:42:04,630 --> 00:42:05,290
Right here.

908
00:42:05,760 --> 00:42:07,670
You recite it backwards,
and I'll be the judge.

909
00:42:07,670 --> 00:42:08,880
All the students here

910
00:42:09,110 --> 00:42:10,030
are witnesses.

911
00:42:10,440 --> 00:42:12,640
Let's see how you'll astound everyone.

912
00:42:16,230 --> 00:42:17,110
He is serious?

913
00:42:17,570 --> 00:42:19,070
How come his hearing is so good?

914
00:42:19,070 --> 00:42:20,320
How do you plan

915
00:42:20,550 --> 00:42:23,010
to spend your four years
as undergraduates?

916
00:42:23,510 --> 00:42:25,840
Of course, you'll study legal provisions

917
00:42:26,000 --> 00:42:27,330
and acquire knowledge.

918
00:42:27,860 --> 00:42:28,730
You must also

919
00:42:28,760 --> 00:42:30,820
master the inherent logic of the law,

920
00:42:31,070 --> 00:42:32,470
develop legal thinking,

921
00:42:33,230 --> 00:42:35,710
and grow accustomed
to using it to judge matters,

922
00:42:35,710 --> 00:42:36,970
understand the world,

923
00:42:37,360 --> 00:42:38,690
and guide your actions.

924
00:42:39,000 --> 00:42:39,760
Otherwise,

925
00:42:40,200 --> 00:42:41,370
you will not be able

926
00:42:41,400 --> 00:42:43,800
to become a qualified legal professional.

927
00:42:45,000 --> 00:42:46,280
Walking through this door

928
00:42:46,280 --> 00:42:47,710
means a complete transformation

929
00:42:47,710 --> 00:42:48,710
and a fresh start.

930
00:42:50,320 --> 00:42:51,230
I hope that in the future,

931
00:42:51,230 --> 00:42:52,360
every one of you here

932
00:42:52,920 --> 00:42:54,780
will be able to become a qualified

933
00:42:57,000 --> 00:42:58,200
legal professional.

934
00:42:59,750 --> 00:43:03,960
[The People's University
of Political Science and Law]

935
00:42:59,750 --> 00:43:03,960
[Legal professional]
